sn54.13:6.3 starts: trains himself, ‘I will breathe in…&…out sensitive to mental fabrication’;
sn54.13:8.3 starts: trains himself, ‘I will breathe in…&…out focusing on cessation’;
sn54.13:8.4 starts: trains himself, ‘I will breathe in…&…out focusing on relinquishing’:
sn54.13:10.3 starts: on that occasion his mindfulness is steady & without lapse.
